Subject: [PATCH 43/67] Implement video capture module. JB#53982

Port the Sailfish geckocamera backend to current libwebrtc interfaces.
Retain mapped frame ownership and rotate camera frames during IPC copying.

Allow WebRTC's reference-counting wrapper to subclass the Sailfish
capture implementation, matching the other platform modules.
